OL,3,GNEWSA'Unjustifiable' runway upgrade
OL,4,Adelays criticised
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised after a
OL,7,Fproject to rebuild an island airport's
OL,8,Frunway were delayed.
OL,10,FThe decision not to widen Alderney
OL,11,FAirport's runway from 18m (59ft) to 23m
OL,12,F(75ft) to meet regulatory guidelines
OL,13,Fand hold off on any work happening
OL,14,Funtil 2028 has been criticised by
OL,15,Fislanders and aviation experts.
OL,17,FGiles Woodhouse, who travels from
OL,18,FAlderney to the UK frequently, said the
OL,19,Fdelay left question marks as to whether
OL,20,F"living on this beautiful island was
OL,21,Fstill viable".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
